// Episode 1 · Open-source research indicator
//
// Visualizes ceiling and floor geometric angles from the
// Isotropic Coordinate System (ICS) as trend lines on the
// price chart. Two right-triangles — ceiling (HH → high)
// and floor (LL → low) — reveal the geometric trajectory
// of price relative to its frozen structural boundaries.
//
// ICS coordinate space:
//   y = log(price) / sigma    (dimensionless)
//   x = bars / lookback       (dimensionless)
//   theta = atan(Δy/Δx) × 180/π   (degrees, signed)
//
// © SmartTraders Research Labs — Open Source
